  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>螢幕上的火焰變小了！</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>適用版本</strong> <strong>26.2</strong>&nbsp;<strong>至</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>1.8</strong><strong>！</strong><strong><br></strong></span><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">（無需 OptiFine！）</span><br><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong>特色</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; 原版火焰&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 火焰變小 🔥</strong><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/433/29/half.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"633\"></span></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✔️</span> </span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>當你著火時，火焰不會遮擋整個螢幕，只會佔據一小部分</strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/433/32/norm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"633\"></span></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✔️ </span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>地面上的火焰保持不變，不像其他材質包那樣被修改</strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RRxvWKNC/images/8b3ce73ec529c01ee05c5f056a55db8a8095e6f2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"783\" height=\"407\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">非常適合 PvP 或一般的 Minecraft 生存模式遊玩<br>歡迎在您的 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">CurseForge 模組包</span>中使用此材質包！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您有任何建議或需求，請在下方留言，我會盡力協助您。</span></p>",
